          "Avoid abstract national narratives on immigration, climate, or ideology. Ground all messaging in local impacts: Which jobs does this policy create or protect here? Does it make my neighborhood safer and more affordable? Generic partisan rhetoric will underperform in a district focused on practical survival and order."
