          { name: "Urban-Rural or Cultural Cosmopolitanism Framing", tag: "avoid", why: "The combination of low college attainment, median age of 38.5, high white percentage, and overwhelming Republican preference indicates a district with deeply rooted cultural conservatism and skepticism of institutions coded as coastal or academic. Messaging that divides the world into 'backward rural' versus 'enlightened urban' values will alienate the base. Candidates must speak as insiders to the district's own norms, not missionaries from elsewhere." }
